WEBVTT

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.710
Literature Club

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.830
President Amane sure is late...

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:27.880
Nanako. Act somethin' out 
and I'll guess what it is.

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:36.080
Got it! A roller coaster!

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:39.850
Alright!

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.630
Hold on! Are we gonna ignore 
that crazy wind just now?!

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.500
Gentle words

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.630
Soft feelings

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:56.540
Precious memories

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:03.120
They're dyed with love

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:09.380
When I'm with you, even getting caught
in the rain turns into something new

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:12.580
What words can I string together

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:15.720
To keep this color from fading away?

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:17.290
I know

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:23.210
What the two of us will 
become on that far-off day

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:28.630
Isn't that right, God?

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:32.150
Waiting for the train, the 
water droplets beading up

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:34.710
I really wish this moment

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:39.710
Could somehow last forever

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:41.750
Is that too much to ask?

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Poem 3:   Let's Go to the Amusement Park

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:51.960
Hmm...

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.750
Theme

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.380
Roller coasters don't scare you, Nanako?

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:57.560
Actually, I love

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:59.130
All kinds of different thrill rides.

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:00.590
They're a ton of fun!

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:01.630
I see...

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:03.480
I'm guessing that you

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.100
Get a little motion sick

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.250
On those kinds of rides?

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:09.350
Wh-what are you talkin' about?

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:13.670
I'm a MAN! I ain't so soft that
I'd let some dumb ride make me sick!

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:16.960
MANLY MAN

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:16.630
But just the other day...

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:20.880
you had to kneel down on the train
because you got so nauseous.

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:23.040
D-don't sell me out like that!

00:02:21.170 --> 00:02:23.500
You good?

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:23.040
You good?

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:27.670
Aside from that...
What's the theme for today, President?

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:31.540
Let's go with... "Amusement Park Memories."

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:31.630
THEME
"Amusement Park

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:35.050
THEME
"Amusement Park
Memories"

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.790
Go ahead and give it a whirl.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.050
Right!

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:37.120
Kids can't stand waiting

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.510
In all the long lines, so they

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:39.540
Start throwing tantrums

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.260
So true!

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:46.830
When you're young, it's hard to be patient.
You whine 'til you tire yourself out,

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:49.630
and then you just pass 
out on the spot, y'know?

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:51.290
At least wake up for the ride!

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:54.790
Kids also tend to

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.230
Get upset and throw tantrums

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.500
When it's time to leave

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.380
I'd love to see little 
Nanako-chan making a big fuss.

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:02.530
What were your tantrums like?

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.290
I broke my shoelace!

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:09.060
I can't walk all the way home!

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:11.710
We have to stay here!

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.210
Oh my gosh, that's so cute!

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:15.920
So, what'd your parents do?

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:21.210
Now, now. If you keep this up, 
you might get left behind.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:23.540
Like your papa.

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:27.210
He's having his own freak-out!

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.630
Okay, you're up next, President.

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:33.710
Huh? It's kinda embarrassing, but...

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:37.050
Though unrequited,

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:39.240
Spending time with my love was

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.420
Like a dream come true

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:44.320
Talk about bittersweet!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.880
Was he a looker?

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:49.000
Oh yeah, he was totally hot.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:55.960
We were paired up together during
our middle school field trip, you see.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:59.210
I was so nervous that I couldn't
even bring myself to talk to him.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:02.580
Wha-?! Why isn't he wearing clothes?!

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.420
What's up, Nanako?

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:10.330
I was just thinking

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:11.760
We should go as a club to

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:13.140
An amusement park!

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:19.790
Ah, that sounds fun!
Let's all go together on our next day off.

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.790
Whoa, really?!

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:23.480
I just realized that

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:24.970
I have no clue what to wear!

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:26.080
Got any ideas?

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:29.130
I think it's the perfect 
chance to get dressed up!

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:31.040
I'm gonna look good, too!

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.380
Just wait 'til you see my school uniform
when it's all ironed!

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:34.880
Please wear normal clothes.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:45.670
I don't think I really have 
any "normal clothes"...

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:49.750
Eiji, I just heard! You're 
going to an amusement park?

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:52.960
How nice! Can your big sister come too?

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:54.960
Gah! Quit being so clingy!

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:58.420
Oh, but I'd probably just get in the way...

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:00.920
After all, you wouldn't get 
to flirt with Nanako-chan.

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:04.380
Wha-?! Wh-wh-what are
you talking about, Big Sis Koto?!

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.630
Don't take pictures of me!

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.510
Hey Hiro-kun,

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.910
Out of these two, which outfit

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:15.000
Looks better on me?

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.540
They both look the same to me.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:21.500
Okay! It's getting late, 
you two. Time for bed.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.710
'Kay.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:26.170
I knew this day would come eventually...

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:32.130
Nanako's going... to an 
amusement park with a boy...

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:33.430
Guh!

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:37.710
Nanako... My sweet, little Nanako...

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:43.380
I felt like maybe... I'd never have
to see her leave my side, but...

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:50.250
But the truth is... that 
was just my ego talking...

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:56.920
Mom! Dad's doing it again!

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:02.750
A-ha-ha! Welcome to Nacky Land!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:06.670
Yo, Nanako! You sure are 
early. Didja wait long?

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:21.710
It's from the president.

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:26.330
President Amane
I'm sorry
Something came up, so I can't go
Have fun, you two!!
Thumbs-up!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.000
I'm sorry!

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.830
Something came up, so I can't go.

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:26.330
Have fun, you two!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:35.130
Wait, so... it's just the two of us?!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.290
Well, should we head inside?

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:44.210
Sorry, guys. Nothing came 
up, it was just an excuse.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.720
I'd love to hang out with
the both of you at an amusement park.

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:50.540
But what I'd love even more...

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:54.130
...is to spy on your date from afar.

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:56.210
That's WAY more fun for me!

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:59.040
Mama, that girl's really weird!

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.390
You just gotta get

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:07.650
These kinds of things when you go

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:08.830
To amusement parks!

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:11.580
O-ho! They look good on you!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:18.830
Huh?! I gotta wear 'em too?!
C'mon, I'm gonna look really lame...

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.500
But I guess... I might as well.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:28.790
Well?! Am I adorable?!

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:41.000
I totally thought

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.630
My heart was going to leap

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:43.750
Right out of my chest!

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:45.460
Yeah...

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:50.580
That one was scary!

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:52.210
My legs feel like jelly, and

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:53.330
I can barely stand!

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:58.540
Y'know... I feel like I should 
be the one sayin' all this...

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:05.330
A-ha! Is everyone having 
fun? I'm Nacky Rabbit!

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:08.540
All you boys and girls who want
a kiss from Nacky, gather 'round!

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.210
Here we go!

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:11.500
And... kiss!

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.880
Here's one for you! Kiss!

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:15.970
And one for you...

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:17.170
Kiss!

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:24.630
What the...?! Nacky suddenly
started licking that dude's shoes!

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:27.880
Stop it! I can't bear to 
see you like this, Nacky!

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:32.380
Mascots have gotten a lot 
cooler since I was a kid!

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:35.630
They give you kisses AND 
they lick your shoes!

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:38.250
Hm? What's wrong, Nanako?

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.180
It's not fair, Ei-chan...

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:43.080
I can't believe Nacky stole

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.250
Your very first kiss...

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:46.670
Huh?! H-hey!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:49.750
My first kiss? What does it matt...

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.720
I... Th-that's...

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:57.340
W-wouldn't drinking outta somethin'
like this be really lame?!

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:00.260
W-well, this place, you see...

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:02.260
It looks like they only have

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:03.540
This one size, really...

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:06.250
U-uh, that so?

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:07.830
That's pretty weird!

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:14.330
But, well... I am thirsty... And it'd be
a waste not to drink it, so I guess I gotta...

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:18.500
Th-th-then, should we drink 
it on the count of three?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.330
My, my! How precious~

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:32.500
Something tells me you don't
have a boyfriend, President...

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:35.970
Hey! I've got my eye on a guy or two...!

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:39.130
But... no, I don't.

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:56.130
Man, today was a blast!

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:59.230
I'm sure your parents must 
be gettin' worried by now,

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:01.320
so how 'bout we call it a day?

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:05.500
We hit up pretty much all 
of the attractions, anyway.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:08.000
Let's come back with the president and
Bis Sis Koto next time.

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.580
What's up? Gotta use the bathroom?

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:18.690
I broke my shoelace,

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:20.630
So I can't really walk home...

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.290
What should we do now?

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:24.750
Nanako...

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.460
Jeez, you're such a dork...

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:54.670
You don't even have shoelaces!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.010
WHY ARE YOU SO STUPID?!

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.580
P-President?! Big Sis Koto?!

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:15.540
It's almost funny how different we are

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:20.920
Down to our reflections in the shop window

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:26.580
When you smile as brightly as the sun

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:35.130
A peaceful feeling washes over me

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:42.330
Even my trivial, everyday life

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:47.920
Begins to shine when I'm with you

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:51.380
Even if something happened

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:54.540
Even if we hurt each other sometimes

00:11:54.540 --> 00:12:01.880
Believe in our ordinary days

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:07.180
On the next epi-

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:08.630
-sode of Senryu Girl:

00:12:08.630 --> 00:12:09.820
The Canvas G-

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:10.750
-irl!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:13.750
Next Time, Poem 4
"The Canvas Girl"
